      <section class="mm-net" aria-label="Network status">
        <div class="mm-net-head">
          <span class="mm-live"><span class="mm-live-dot" id="mm-live-dot"></span><span id="mm-live-text">Checking status…</span></span>
          <h2>Live from the edge.</h2>
          <p>Uptime is reported by the server. Latencies are typical estimates per region — refreshed quietly in the background.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="mm-net-grid">
          <div class="mm-net-readout">
            <div class="mm-up"><strong id="mm-up">—</strong><span id="mm-up-label">uptime · last 24h</span>
              <div class="mm-range" role="group" aria-label="Uptime range">
                <button type="button" data-range="24h" class="mm-range-btn mm-range-on" aria-pressed="true">24h</button>
                <button type="button" data-range="7d" class="mm-range-btn" aria-pressed="false">7d</button>
                <button type="button" data-range="30d" class="mm-range-btn" aria-pressed="false">30d</button>
                <button type="button" data-range="1y" class="mm-range-btn" aria-pressed="false">1y</button>
                <button type="button" data-range="all" class="mm-range-btn" aria-pressed="false">All</button>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="mm-ping"><strong id="mm-ping">—</strong><span id="mm-ping-label">typical US latency</span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="mm-map" role="img" aria-label="World map with estimated latency per region">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 640 320" aria-hidden="true">
              <rect x="8" y="8" width="624" height="304" rx="18" class="mm-map-bg" />
              <g class="mm-dots" id="mm-dots"></g>
              <g class="mm-map-links" id="mm-links"></g>
              <g id="mm-nodes"></g>
            </svg>
            <ul class="mm-regions" id="mm-regions"></ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="goals mm-pillars" id="goals">
        <div class="section-head">
          <span class="eyebrow">Why Manumit</span>
          <h2>Software that sets you free.</h2>
          <p>Three commitments shape everything I build — no compromises, no fine print.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="goal-grid mm-grid">
          <div class="goal-card mm-card">
            <div class="mm-icon" aria-hidden="true">◈</div>
            <h3>Free entirely</h3>
            <p>Every app is completely unlocked. No paywalls, no ads, no premium tiers. The price is zero and always will be.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="goal-card mm-card">
            <div class="mm-icon" aria-hidden="true">⬢</div>
            <h3>Quality, not cheap</h3>
            <p>Free never means cut corners. Every release is polished, tested, and held to the same high bar.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="goal-card mm-card">
            <div class="mm-icon" aria-hidden="true">⬣</div>
            <h3>Privacy by default</h3>
            <p>Local-first wherever possible, encrypted when optional sync is used, and permanently deletable at any time.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="mm-spotlight">
        <div class="mm-spot-copy">
          <span class="eyebrow">Flagship app</span>
          <h2>Split Task — plan days, weeks, and months on one screen.</h2>
          <p>Tasks and events with categories, notifications, and optional encrypted sync. Free forever, on web and Android.</p>
          <div class="actions">
            <a class="btn primary" href="/products/split-task/">Explore Split Task</a>
            <a class="btn secondary" href="/products/split-task/app/">Launch the app</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="mm-spot-visual" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="mm-mock"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="stack mm-stack" id="tech-stack">
        <div class="section-head">
          <span class="eyebrow">Built on the edge</span>
          <h2>One global platform, end to end.</h2>
          <p>From tap to database — modern tools on one global edge network.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="stack-grid">
          <a class="stack-item stack-item--cloudflare" href="https://www.cloudflare.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
