              <h3>Cloudflare</h3>
            </div>
            <p>Workers serve the API, D1 holds the database, and Pages hosts the site - one edge platform end to end.</p>
            <ul class="stack-tags">
              <li>Workers</li>
              <li>D1</li>
              <li>Pages</li>
            </ul>
